    "codeql_raw_query": "/**\n * @name Potential infinite loops in ASN.1 decoder\n * @description Looking for while loops in ASN.1 decoder that could lead to denial of service\n * @kind problem\n * @problem.severity error\n * @id py/infinite-loop-asn1\n * @tags security\n *        external/cwe/cwe-835\n */\n\nimport python\n\n// Simple query to find while loops in decoder files\nfrom Stmt whileStmt\nwhere\n  whileStmt instanceof While and\n  whileStmt.getLocation().getFile().getBaseName().matches(\"%decoder%\") and\n  (\n    whileStmt.getLocation().getFile().getParent().getBaseName().matches(\"%ber%\") or\n    whileStmt.getLocation().getFile().getParent().getBaseName().matches(\"%der%\") or\n    whileStmt.getLocation().getFile().getParent().getBaseName().matches(\"%cer%\")\n  )\nselect whileStmt, \"While loop found in ASN.1 decoder that could potentially lead to infinite loop or denial of service if not properly bounded.\"",
    "hypothesis": "While loops in ASN.1 decoders could lead to infinite loops or denial of service if malicious input causes unbounded iteration",
